    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the Kingdom of<strong> Foxingdale </strong>in this retro<strong>\u00a0\u00a0</strong>action adventure game, 90s Anime  aesthetics</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652030/extras/be49de9bfff47c762d65fcdd49e8d4e8.poster.avif?t=1752326841\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652030/extras/be49de9bfff47c762d65fcdd49e8d4e8.webm?t=1752326841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652030/extras/9b975284fd67409926407a3724367cb3.avif?t=1752326841\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The evil sorcerer of the Northern kingdoms in search of the lost Magical stones of Kentaroo,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Legend has it that whoever possess the Magical stones will become the most powerful ruler of all the kingdoms.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A brave adventurer by the name of Aoi must  set out on a quest to find The lost stones of Kentaroo before they fall into the wrong hands</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652030/extras/e9a06c0e196962d8fa09959d370ae372.avif?t=1752326841\" width=550 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652030/extras/7a43388079dbd06161f9cd1104af1e46.avif?t=1752326841\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel  around the Realm of FoxingDale by using a open world map to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a 2D Retro adventure </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing pre-rendered digital images for  nostalgic aesthetics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 2D side scroller</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn fantasy world anime</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamlined gaming Action</strong>,  for a faster casual enjoyable experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652030/extras/5da1240388e4073db540d1bda50d00df.avif?t=1752326841\" width=550 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652030/extras/83f4070e355eef4f741f2627e6ceeb43.avif?t=1752326841\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You play as Aoi a would`be adventurer who must set out on a quest to find the three Magical stones of Kentaroo</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To find the stones you must travel through the realm of foxingdale by using your map to select a kingdom to explore, talk to the towns folk of foxingdale to help guide you on your quest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Watch out for Masked raiders and bandits sent by the evil sorcerer, who are also looking for the Magical stones , you must protect yourself by using your short sword to attack your enemys including dragons and elfs  who will cross your path</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
